WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:08.133
Oh, my God.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.593
I'm feeling so

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:13.013
beyond words.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:13.972
I'm I'm in shock,
I’m totally shocked.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:15.265
I haven’t proccesed it yet.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:17.350
I kinda can’t take it,
right now.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.060
I think the joy of life is

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.937
not knowing what's 
going to happen.

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:22.480
And that's, you know,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.649
that's what makes 
life so exciting.

00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:26.735
You know, any time 
I think about the idea

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:30.196
of telling my younger self
my future, I would love,

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.324
I would love to see the reaction
of my younger self knowing.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:37.162
But I also think that, again,
like that is the joy of living,

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:39.039
is experiencing

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.959
new, surprising
aspects of life.

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:44.627
And that’s what this is.

